---@field billing_period number|distilled.Null Number of days between recurring charges, such as 30 for monthly or 365 for annual. `null` for one-time plans.
---@field cancel_discount_intervals number|distilled.Null Billing intervals the cancellation discount applies to (`0` forever, `1` first payment, or a month count). `null` when none is offered or the actor lacks the `plan:basic:read` scope.
