---@field created_at string When the plan was created, as an ISO 8601 timestamp.
---@field currency string Three-letter ISO currency code for this plan's prices.
---@field custom_fields whop.plans.PlanListItemCustomFieldsList
---@field description string|distilled.Null Customer-visible plan description. Maximum 1000 characters. `null` if no description is set.
---@field expiration_days number|distilled.Null Access duration in days for expiration-based plans, such as 365 for a one-year pass. `null` for plans without an expiration.
---@field formatted_price string Human-readable price for display (currency + interval), e.g. "$10 / month".
---@field id string Plan ID, prefixed `plan_`.
---@field image any|distilled.Null Pricing-tier image (`url`, `blurhash`) shown on the product page; `null` when no image is set.
---@field initial_price number Initial purchase price in plan currency.
---@field initial_price_due whop.plans.Money Total charged at checkout for one unit, before promo codes and tax: `initial_price` plus the first `renewal_price` for recurring plans, or `initial_price` alone while a free trial applies. The trial does not apply when the viewing user has already used one for this plan.
---@field internal_notes string|distilled.Null Private notes not shown to customers. `null` unless the actor has the `plan:basic:read` scope on the plan's account.
---@field invoice any|distilled.Null Invoice this plan was generated for; `null` unless created for an invoice.
---@field member_count number|distilled.Null Active memberships through this plan. `null` unless the actor has the `plan:basic:read` scope on the plan's account.
---@field metadata any|distilled.Null Custom key-value pairs stored on the plan. Included in webhook payloads for payment and membership events. Maximum 50 keys, 100 characters per key, 500 characters per value. The reserved keys `custom_cta` and `custom_cta_url`, when set, override the product's checkout call to action for this plan.
---@field offer_cancel_discount boolean|distilled.Null Whether a cancellation discount is offered. `null` unless the actor has the `plan:basic:read` scope on the plan's account.
---@field payment_method_configuration any|distilled.Null Payment method configuration (`enabled`, `disabled`, `include_platform_defaults`); `null` when plan uses default settings.
---@field plan_type whop.plans.PlanListItemPlanType Billing model for this plan.
---@field product any|distilled.Null Product this plan belongs to; `null` for standalone plans.
---@field purchase_url string URL where customers can purchase this plan directly.
---@field release_method whop.plans.PlanListItemReleaseMethod Sales method for this plan.
---@field renewal_price number Recurring price charged every billing period.
---@field sku string|distilled.Null Stock keeping unit, free text set by the seller (e.g. `TSHIRT-LARGE-BLUE`). Not enforced unique. `null` when unset.
---@field split_pay_required_payments number|distilled.Null Installment payments required before the subscription pauses. Must be greater than 1. `null` if split pay is not configured.
---@field stock number|distilled.Null Units available for purchase. `null` unless the actor has the `plan:basic:read` scope on the plan's account.
---@field strike_through_initial_price number|distilled.Null Original initial price shown with a strikethrough, in the plan's currency. `null` when no strikethrough is set.
---@field strike_through_renewal_price number|distilled.Null Original renewal price shown with a strikethrough, in the plan's currency. `null` when no strikethrough is set.
---@field three_ds_level whop.plans.PlanListItemThreeDsLevel|distilled.Null 3D Secure behavior for supported on-session card payments. `mandate_challenge` requires a 3DS challenge before payment processing; `mandate_if_required` mandates a challenge only when the payment processor requires it; `frictionless_if_required` uses the regular frictionless 3DS flow. Payments of $1,000 or more use `mandate_if_required` unless `mandate_challenge` is selected. Risk and authentication recovery requirements can override the preference. `null` inherits the account default.
---@field title string|distilled.Null Plan display name shown to customers. Maximum 30 characters. A variant created without one defaults to its attribute values joined with ` / `. `null` if no title has been set.
---@field trial_period_days number|distilled.Null Free trial days before the first renewal charge. `null` if no trial is configured or the user has already used a trial for this plan.
---@field unlimited_stock boolean Whether the plan has unlimited stock. When `true`, the `stock` field is ignored; waitlist plans always report `true`.
---@field updated_at string When the plan was last updated, as an ISO 8601 timestamp.
---@field visibility whop.plans.PlanListItemVisibility Controls where this plan can be seen. When `hidden`, the plan is reachable only by its direct link.

