---@class whop.plans.UpdatePlanRequest
---@field id string Plan ID, prefixed `plan_`.
---@field adaptive_pricing_enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Whether this plan accepts local currency payments via adaptive pricing.
---@field attributes? any|distilled.Null Attribute values that make this plan one variant of its product, as a map of attribute name to value, e.g. `{"size": "Large", "color": "Blue"}`. Names are normalized to snake_case identifiers (`Ring Size` becomes `ring_size`) and come back in alphabetical order. Every variant plan on a product must carry the same attribute names and a distinct set of values. Send `null` to make the plan an ordinary pricing option again.
---@field billing_period? number|distilled.Null Recurring billing interval in days, such as 30 for monthly or 365 for annual.
---@field cancel_discount_intervals? number|distilled.Null How many renewals the retention discount applies to. Required when `offer_cancel_discount` is true.
---@field cancel_discount_percentage? number|distilled.Null Percentage taken off each discounted renewal. Required when `offer_cancel_discount` is true.
---@field checkout_styling? any|distilled.Null Checkout styling overrides for this plan.
---@field currency? string The three-letter ISO currency code for the plan's pricing. Defaults to USD.
---@field custom_fields? whop.plans.UpdatePlanRequestCustomFieldsList|distilled.Null An array of custom field definitions to collect from customers at checkout. Omitting this field clears existing custom fields.
---@field description? string|distilled.Null A text description of the plan displayed to customers on the product page.
---@field expiration_days? number|distilled.Null Access duration in days before the membership expires.
---@field image? whop.plans.UpdatePlanRequestImage|distilled.Null An image displayed on the product page to represent this plan.
---@field initial_price? number|distilled.Null Initial amount charged in the plan's currency, e.g. 10.43 for $10.43. A paid fiat plan charges at least 1.00 in its currency; use 0 for free.
---@field internal_notes? string|distilled.Null Private notes visible only to the account owner. Not shown to customers.
---@field metadata? any|distilled.Null Custom key-value pairs to store on the plan. Included in webhook payloads for payment and membership events. Max 50 keys, 100 chars per key, 500 chars per string value. The reserved keys `custom_cta` (a checkout call-to-action button label — one of the product custom CTA values, e.g. `subscribe`, `get_offer`) and `custom_cta_url` (a URL the button links to; web or `tel:`) override the product's call to action for this plan and are validated on save.
---@field offer_cancel_discount? boolean|distilled.Null Whether to offer a retention discount when a customer attempts to cancel.
---@field override_tax_type? string Override the default tax classification for this specific plan.
---@field payment_method_configuration? whop.plans.UpdatePlanRequestPaymentMethodConfiguration|distilled.Null Explicit payment method configuration for the plan. When not provided, the account's defaults apply. Send at least one of `enabled` or `disabled`; an omitted one is empty.
---@field release_method? string Sales method for this plan.
---@field renewal_price? number|distilled.Null The amount charged each billing period for recurring plans, in the plan's currency. A paid fiat plan charges at least 1.00 in its currency.
---@field sku? string|distilled.Null Stock keeping unit for this plan. Maximum 100 characters. Free text, not enforced unique.
---@field stock? number|distilled.Null The maximum number of units available for purchase. Ignored when unlimited_stock is true.
---@field strike_through_initial_price? number|distilled.Null A comparison price displayed with a strikethrough for the initial price.
---@field strike_through_renewal_price? number|distilled.Null A comparison price displayed with a strikethrough for the renewal price.
---@field three_ds_level? whop.plans.UpdatePlanRequestThreeDsLevel|string|distilled.Null 3D Secure behavior for supported on-session card payments. `mandate_challenge` requires a 3DS challenge before payment processing; `mandate_if_required` mandates a challenge only when the payment processor requires it; `frictionless_if_required` uses the regular frictionless 3DS flow. Payments of $1,000 or more use `mandate_if_required` unless `mandate_challenge` is selected. Risk and authentication recovery requirements can override the preference. Send `null` to inherit the account default.
---@field title? string|distilled.Null The display name of the plan shown to customers on the product page. Maximum 30 characters.
---@field trial_period_days? number|distilled.Null Free trial duration before the first recurring charge.
---@field unlimited_stock? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the plan has unlimited stock. When true, the stock field is ignored.
---@field visibility? string Whether the plan is visible to customers or hidden from public view.

